  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This red curry serves 4 and takes about 35 minutes from start to finish. The method fries the curry paste in the thick part of "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "coconut milk",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "coconut-milk"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " before adding the pork, which gives a deeper, richer flavour than simply simmering everything together."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Buy full-fat coconut milk. The thick cream that rises to the top is what you fry the paste in. Shake the tin only lightly so the cream stays separate."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
